{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since the incident of the N\u00e9ombre Rift, the Vermalian Lands have become hostile and are now inhabited by aggressive creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a group of explorers seeking answers in a cooperative adventure where every battle tests your individual strengths and your team's strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a beginner or an experienced player, the Vermalian Lands call to you! Accessible and engaging from the very first game, this card game quickly evolves into a demanding strategic adventure. Discover innovative mechanics, refine your strategies, and join forces to triumph in a journey as dark as it is intriguing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Les Nomin\u00e9es du N\u00e9ombre</strong> is a cooperative strategy card game set in a dark fantasy universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress from zone to zone and build your deck, you will face increasingly fierce opponents and earn loot to enhance your deck.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3463000?t=1746461493","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3463000?t=1746461493","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463000/03ab5e034c42d127b09f0c271d30cbbc077775f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746461493","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463000/03ab5e034c42d127b09f0c271d30cbbc077775f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746461493","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since the incident of the N\u00e9ombre Rift, the Vermalian Lands have become hostile and are now inhabited by aggressive creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">